# Only our own work is tracked. Everything ComfyUI-Easy-Install ships (python_embeded, ComfyUI core,
# models, other custom nodes, outputs) stays untracked so this repo can live inside any
# ComfyUI-Easy-Install folder.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!setup.bat
!Start ComfyUI CPU.bat

!workflow/
!workflow/**

!custom_nodes/
!custom_nodes/ComfyUI-ShortsRemake/
!custom_nodes/ComfyUI-ShortsRemake/**

!tools/
!tools/**

__pycache__/
*.pyc
